ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.","Un héros fluide de DOTA2 qui maîtrise les vagues déferlantes, bascule librement entre Force et Agilité, se renforce grâce à Flux et Reflux et prend l'apparence de ses ennemis."
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.","Un maître-lame masqué de DOTA2 qui accumule un élan imparable avec Forme de lame, fend la magie grâce à Furie de la lame, soutient ses alliés avec Balise de soin et fauche ses ennemis via Danse de la lame et Omnislash."
ClassDescription,"A relentless DOTA2 crimson berserker who thrives alone with One Man Army, taunts entire rooms with Berserker's Call, carves attackers with Pure Counter Helix spins, and executes the weak with Culling Blade.",
